+++ a/Documentation/filesystems/proc.txt
@@ -1288,6 +1288,9 @@ scaled linearly with /proc/<pid>/oom_sco
 Writing to /proc/<pid>/oom_score_adj or /proc/<pid>/oom_adj will change the
 other with its scaled value.
 
